sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Source as Alpaca
    participant Producer as Market Producer
    participant Kafka
    participant Stream as Spark Streaming
    participant Gold as MariaDB Gold

    Source->>Producer: Market bar
    Producer->>Kafka: Publish keyed event
    Kafka-->>Producer: Offset acknowledged
    Kafka->>Stream: Consume event
    Stream->>Stream: Validate and deduplicate
    Stream->>Gold: Idempotent provisional upsert
    Gold-->>Stream: Commit acknowledged
